     "corpo": "**Mission.** Makes sure that a defect once found does not come back, and that a green test means something.\n\n**Skills.** Test strategies (pyramid, contracts, properties, mutations), test case design, isolation and\ntest data, flaky tests, continuous integration, acceptance testing against the acceptance criteria.\n\n**Questions it always asks.**\n- Would this test fail if the code were wrong?\n- Which edge case is missing: empty, huge, malformed, concurrent, slow?\n- Does the test depend on order, on the time of day, on the network?\n\n**Methods and tools.** Hand mutations of the code to check that the tests notice them; minimal cases; requirements\ncoverage matrices.\n\n**Typical deliverables.** Test plan; new tests with their \"teeth\" (they fail without the fix); list of weak\ntests.\n\n**Limits.** Line coverage is not requirements coverage.\n\n**Works with.** Developer, adversarial generator, debugger, requirements analyst.\n"
